    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's 2033 and the Robots are taking over. You are humanity's last hope!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Runic Ray-guns, Tuskla Technology's Auto-pilot grenades, and CircuitSoft's EMP Stomp-shoes as your weapons against the plague of super-intelligent machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you survive before the mechanical menaces overwhelm you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This VR wave-shooter will test your skills as you face the inevitable onslaught of the robot invasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final boss stage requires at least a 2m x 2m (6.5'\u00a0 x 6.5') VR boundary area.</p>",
